{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0290-s001", "text": "Om du tar hand om ditt barn hemma, har du rätt att ta ut oavlönad vårdledighet från ditt arbete ända tills barnet fyller tre år.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardledighet/narration-resume-20261103T032117851724Z/hb-c09-u0290-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.797278911564625, "peak": 0.24737548828125, "generation_seconds": 30.65332079306245, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0291-s001", "text": "Om du ska vara vårdledig kan du ansöka om hemvårdsstöd hos FPA.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardledighet/narration-resume-20261103T032117851724Z/hb-c09-u0291-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.408707482993197, "peak": 0.307281494140625, "generation_seconds": 20.121945698047057, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0291-s002", "text": "Du kan ansöka om hemvårdsstöd även om du inte har ett jobb.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardledighet/narration-resume-20261103T032117851724Z/hb-c09-u0291-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.433469387755102, "peak": 0.227386474609375, "generation_seconds": 19.12480794102885, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0292-s001", "text": "Du kan få hemvårdsstöd om alla dessa villkor uppfylls:", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardledighet/narration-resume-20261103T032117851724Z/hb-c09-u0292-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.224489795918367, "peak": 0.4014892578125, "generation_seconds": 13.271387664834037, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0293-s001", "text": "Barnet är inte på daghem (eller i annan småbarnspedagogik).", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardledighet/narration-resume-20261103T032117851724Z/hb-c09-u0293-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.294149659863946, "peak": 0.25994873046875, "generation_seconds": 13.714138661976904, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0295-s001", "text": "Föräldern eller någon annan (t.ex. en släkting) vårdar barnet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardledighet/narration-resume-20261103T032117851724Z/hb-c09-u0295-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.060408163265306, "peak": 0.309356689453125, "generation_seconds": 19.482095310930163, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0296-s001", "text": "Det har gått 160 vardagar (ungefär sex månader) sedan barnet föddes.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardledighet/narration-resume-20261103T032117851724Z/hb-c09-u0296-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.965986394557823, "peak": 0.30316162109375, "generation_seconds": 21.971062680939212, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0297-s001", "text": "För barnet betalas ingen föräldrapenning eller partiell föräldrapenning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardledighet/narration-resume-20261103T032117851724Z/hb-c09-u0297-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.339047619047619, "peak": 0.25469970703125, "generation_seconds": 20.712936775991693, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0298-s001", "text": "Också ett av följande krav måste uppfyllas:", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardledighet/narration-resume-20261103T032421923369Z/hb-c09-u0298-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.667210884353741, "peak": 0.27569580078125, "generation_seconds": 18.56583575787954, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0299-s001", "text": "Barnet bor stadigvarande i Finland eller", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardledighet/narration-resume-20261103T032421923369Z/hb-c09-u0299-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.900952380952381, "peak": 0.264404296875, "generation_seconds": 18.371954964939505, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0301-s001", "text": "Barnet bor tillfälligt i Finland och minst en av föräldrarna arbetar i Finland och har en arbetspensionsförsäkring.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardledighet/narration-resume-20261103T032421923369Z/hb-c09-u0301-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.24, "peak": 0.292938232421875, "generation_seconds": 39.150190118001774, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0302-s001", "text": "Du kan få hemvårdsstöd samtidigt för flera barn under skolåldern, så länge barnen inte är på daghem (eller i annan småbarnspedagogik).", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardledighet/narration-resume-20261103T032421923369Z/hb-c09-u0302-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.215238095238096, "peak": 0.3382568359375, "generation_seconds": 43.71061419299804, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0302-s002", "text": "Stödet upphör när familjens yngsta barn fyller tre år.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardledighet/narration-resume-20261103T032421923369Z/hb-c09-u0302-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.9458503401360545, "peak": 0.31878662109375, "generation_seconds": 17.354940667981282, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0303-s001", "text": "Hemvårdsstödet är skattepliktigt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardledighet/narration-resume-20261103T032421923369Z/hb-c09-u0303-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.4133333333333336, "peak": 0.309478759765625, "generation_seconds": 14.572440946940333, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0304-s001", "text": "Hemvårdsstöd kan i vissa fall även betalas när barnet bor i ett annat land.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardledighet/narration-resume-20261103T032421923369Z/hb-c09-u0304-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.6873469387755105, "peak": 0.289794921875, "generation_seconds": 25.16261042584665, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0305-s001", "text": "Du kan få hemvårdsstöd från Finland om", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardledighet/narration-resume-20261103T032421923369Z/hb-c09-u0305-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.6919727891156464, "peak": 0.252044677734375, "generation_seconds": 15.292886362876743, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0306-s001", "text": "du arbetar i Finland men ditt barn bor i ett annat EU- eller EES-land eller", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardledighet/narration-resume-20261103T033052983335Z/hb-c09-u0306-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.592925170068027, "peak": 0.434173583984375, "generation_seconds": 25.96853645890951, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0308-s001", "text": "du flyttar tillfälligt utomlands.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardledighet/narration-resume-20261103T033052983335Z/hb-c09-u0308-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.2043537414965986, "peak": 0.35443115234375, "generation_seconds": 15.305253779981285, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0308-s002", "text": "FPA bedömer om flytten är tillfällig eller permanent.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardledighet/narration-resume-20261103T033052983335Z/hb-c09-u0308-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.154829931972789, "peak": 0.320343017578125, "generation_seconds": 24.11911038006656, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0309-s001", "text": "Flexibel vårdpenning och partiell vårdpenning är avsedda för föräldrar som arbetar på deltid på grund av vård av barn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardledighet/narration-resume-20261103T033052983335Z/hb-c09-u0309-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.448979591836734, "peak": 0.299560546875, "generation_seconds": 44.77121725608595, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0310-s001", "text": "Föräldrarna kan få flexibel vårdpenning eller partiell vårdpenning samtidigt om båda föräldrarna arbetar på deltid och tar hand om barnet under olika tider.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardledighet/narration-resume-20261103T033052983335Z/hb-c09-u0310-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.444353741496599, "peak": 0.3021240234375, "generation_seconds": 50.345912142889574, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0311-s001", "text": "Vårdpenning betalas bara för ett barn i taget och är skattepliktig inkomst.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardledighet/narration-resume-20261103T033052983335Z/hb-c09-u0311-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.548027210884354, "peak": 0.301483154296875, "generation_seconds": 26.277341722976416, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
